{"sequence":28,"timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:53:20.990670745Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-2-8014730a","body":"The `colonizable_area_factor` valid_range upper bound for `coarse_porous.toml` is 1.1, which would mean colonizable area exceeds geometric footprint. Add a brief note in the `param_meta.notes` field explaining why >1.0 is physically meaningful for porous media (surface area exceeding projected area due to void structure) or tighten the upper bound to 1.0 if it should not exceed footprint.","dedup_key":"d81e34d493e42091509603d137c7f1c727425c9c0463b6f476db3ad77291c02a","run_id":"run-20260330104128","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":29,"timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:53:20.999659337Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-2-d7c5dd73","body":"In `docs/PROVENANCE_STATUS.md`, the code-resident solver constants table lists `pKa1(T)` as a formula row but uses a different format from the other rows (inline formula vs. single numeric value). Add an explicit 25°C reference value (≈6.35) alongside the formula for quick cross-referencing with standard carbonate tables, consistent with how `PKA2` is presented.","dedup_key":"df79714157c3bf46c068792c36f283ba8a485a7b54d072a8fa5b3ce7a6a78966","run_id":"run-20260330104128","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":30,"timestamp":"2026-03-30T11:53:21.008740782Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-2-7893222b","body":"Add `param_meta` entries or explicit provisional/TODO notes for the newly introduced shrimp tunables in `/home/master/p/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml:36-60`. The file now exposes `temp_condition_low_divisor_c`, `temp_condition_high_divisor_c`, `molt_stress_condition_midpoint`, `molt_stress_thermal_cap`, `nh3_stress_threshold_mg_n_per_l`, and `nh3_stress_response_scale` as first-class scientific knobs, but the `param_meta` section starting at `/home/master/p/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/data/shrimp/neocaridina_davidi.toml:98` contains no provenance/confidence entries for them.","dedup_key":"8cb9aabeac1cbd9ee8c8aacad0396af662e79d473e0926e896caea0b4e3d2722","run_id":"run-20260330104128","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
